  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><span style=\"color:#000\">此資源包適用於熱門模組「冰與火：嶄新的巨龍！」</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">目標是在保留 Minecraft 及模組本身原版風格的同時，為模組的材質帶來煥然一新的樣貌。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/307316850952241162/828727843299000370/firedragonflying.png\" alt=\"重新材質化的火龍\" width=\"654\" height=\"568\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">未經允許，不得轉載或編輯這些材質。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">感謝 Dohaerys 贈送我巨魔獠牙、龍血和龍角等圖素。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
